  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/knowledge-concurrency.test.ts",
    "title": "SQLite 并发写入等待测试",
    "summary": "通过独立子进程持有真实 SQLite 写锁，验证知识存储会等待锁释放并完成捕获，而不是丢失操作。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "lock-fixture",
        "title": "真实并发写锁场景",
        "body": "测试先初始化数据库，再启动独立 Node 子进程，以 `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` 持有 SQLite 写锁约 250 毫秒。主测试等待子进程明确报告锁已建立后，才创建存储和知识仓库并执行手动材料捕获，因此覆盖的是实际进程间锁竞争，而非模拟异常。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "outcome",
        "title": "完成条件与清理",
        "body": "断言要求捕获结果中的 fragment 保留完整固定文本，同时持锁子进程必须以状态码 0 正常退出，证明写操作等待后成功而未丢失。无论测试结果如何，清理逻辑都会终止仍存活的子进程、关闭存储并删除临时目录。[[c2]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "并发写锁测试装置",
        "reason": "支持子进程持有真实 SQLite 即时事务写锁以及主进程随后执行捕获的流程。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/knowledge-concurrency.test.ts",
          "startLine": 9,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "it(\"waits for a real concurrent writer instead of losing a knowledge operation\", async () => {\n  const dir = mkdtempSync(join(tmpdir(), \"knowledge-busy-\"));\n  const initial = new Store(dir); initial.close();\n  let store: Store | undefined;\n  const child = spawn(process.execPath, [\"--input-type=module\", \"-e\", \"import {D"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "等待结果与资源清理",
        "reason": "支持捕获内容、子进程退出状态以及测试结束时资源清理的断言。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/knowledge-concurrency.test.ts",
          "startLine": 19,
          "endLine": 21
        },
        "quote": "    expect(result.revision.fragments[0]!.text).toBe(\"Fixed material remains available.\");\n    expect(await exited).toBe(0);\n  } finally { if (child.exitCode === null) child.kill(); store?.close(); rmSync(dir, { recursive: true, force: true }); }"
      }
    ],
